title: Macro-Enabled Office Attachment
id: 96699332-6420-49f7-9bf9-619a14be2e8d
status: experimental
description: Detects macro-enabled Office attachments (.docm, .xlsm, .pptm) delivered by email, a common carrier for malicious macros that download or execute second-stage payloads.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1566/001/
logsource:
  category: mail
detection:
  selection:
    attachment_name|endswith:
      - '.docm'
      - '.xlsm'
      - '.pptm'
      - '.dotm'
      - '.xlsb'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - sender
  - recipient
  - subject
falsepositives:
  - Business documents that legitimately use macros
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.initial_access
  - attack.t1566.001
